+`depth2-extension-profile-minimax-completeness-alln` (RESULT 19:31:39Z, id `sha256:Kt48QkiFrYCiz-cDS6qYpyRuOsl9ClK_mAcj6EV8bw4`) — **ACCEPT as honest inconclusive** with verified finite facts and one sound general-poset deduction; not a theorem computing S(n), not a bound, not a class placement. The front correctly declines to settle the all-n question.
